  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186124474,
      "id": "149fa184-850f-52d8-a309-4b79a371a74d",
      "title": "Identifying the Intervals on Which a Function is Invertible Given a Description"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "e1b49586-f997-5246-91b2-82aec9d14e5c",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Given that $f(x)=|x-1|+6,$ on which of the following intervals is $f(x)$ invertible?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x\\in (-\\infty,0]$\n- **II.** $x\\in (0,\\infty)$\n- **III.** $x\\in (1,3]$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The graph of the function $f(x)=|x-1|+6$ can be obtained in the following way:\n\n- Take the curve $y=|x|.$\n\n- Translate it by $1$ unit to the right,  to get $y=|x-1|.$\n\n- Finally, translate $y=|x-1|$ by $6$ units up to get $f(x)=|x-1|+6.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/0c2fa0b361e02fd8264bc422397bcae5e0fd327f011377ba8701bf061deee3ab-0.png)\n\nA function is invertible on a particular interval if and only if it's a one-to-one function on that interval. To determine the intervals on which the function is invertible, we use the horizontal line test. \n\n- The function $f(x)$ is invertible on each of the intervals $x\\in (-\\infty,0]$ and $x\\in (1,3].$ On these intervals, a horizontal line will intersect the curve at most once, no matter where we draw the line.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/0c2fa0b361e02fd8264bc422397bcae5e0fd327f011377ba8701bf061deee3ab-1.png)\n\n  \n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not invertible on the interval $x\\in (0,\\infty).$ On this interval, some horizontal lines will intersect the curve more than once.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186124474/plots/0c2fa0b361e02fd8264bc422397bcae5e0fd327f011377ba8701bf061deee3ab-2.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "ec7f982e-3972-56b3-858f-105e8a24650d",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
